{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/fd49424f40a3ed0b391aada18cf5f953.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/fd49424f40a3ed0b391aada18cf5f953.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/fd49424f40a3ed0b391aada18cf5f953.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/d3bf87409ca9bed17aa7fce8e917d2e3.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/d3bf87409ca9bed17aa7fce8e917d2e3.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/d3bf87409ca9bed17aa7fce8e917d2e3.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/8bb336e9ef90c837cad0cf61ef21fc66.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/8bb336e9ef90c837cad0cf61ef21fc66.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/8bb336e9ef90c837cad0cf61ef21fc66.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/c1aa9d33a921d8303e877c30a6fa5a29.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/c1aa9d33a921d8303e877c30a6fa5a29.webp?t=1757508244\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=392 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/4021a170736213d7752ea936d1c82c3a.avif?t=1757508244\" width=700 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A corporate slave walking the night streets, clinging to his only joy\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">his phone, snatched away in an instant by a dark shadow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Then comes a mocking whisper, calling itself the \u201cKami of Serendipity\u201d:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u201c...Do you wish to meet a girl?\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A white rabbit bound by a red thread lures you through a strange torii.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A flash of light, a world collapsing\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When you awaken, you find yourself in a cold, unfamiliar place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And there... a blood-stained girl, pained and alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2014Will you dare to reach out your hand?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every choice you make will rewrite the fate within \u201cShadow of Memory\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you truly lead them to the \u201cOther Shore\u201d?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/c14160f1612888d8ed70b1245d745478.avif?t=1757508244\" width=700 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Spirit Ofuda: Break the Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine word cards freely and unlock endless puzzle possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f95feddb21c7e617b936e08af51bf384.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f95feddb21c7e617b936e08af51bf384.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f95feddb21c7e617b936e08af51bf384.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Variety of Mini-Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mini-games that aren\u2019t so \u201cmini\u201d \u2014 test your reflexes and wits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/193888ec5325dde95fc6e9ad3489fba0.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/193888ec5325dde95fc6e9ad3489fba0.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/193888ec5325dde95fc6e9ad3489fba0.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Adorable Girls Come to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cat-eared, fox-eared, and bunny-eared girls \u2014 their lively gazes and twitching ears never stop moving\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/5a38bebf67d8b781e6ec464afd7de301.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/5a38bebf67d8b781e6ec464afd7de301.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/5a38bebf67d8b781e6ec464afd7de301.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Diverse Cast, Intertwined Fates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A clumsy but caring older sister, a timid yet brave girl, a bratty little girl who calls herself a god, and a graceful, devoted young wife\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will meet them, accompany them, and make choices that shape their destinies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/b1ab9273cc1c8518642eb1cb9759f29d.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/b1ab9273cc1c8518642eb1cb9759f29d.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/b1ab9273cc1c8518642eb1cb9759f29d.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Atmospheric Japanese Horror Vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into a world of mysterious shrines and shrine maidens. Experience ancient rituals, eerie festivals, and hidden curses as you slowly unravel the buried truth...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f5926ed1670bb627b1ec46c2cb3be99d.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f5926ed1670bb627b1ec46c2cb3be99d.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f5926ed1670bb627b1ec46c2cb3be99d.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/6744800fc0142b77a54fbf45a8f0c6a4.avif?t=1757508244\" width=700 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is best suited for players who enjoy <strong>reading text</strong> to experience the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving puzzles requires reasoning and observation based on the text. Use your <strong>imagination</strong> to find the breakthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter difficulties, use the \u201cHint System\u201d to get crucial clues for a smoother experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3146610?t=1757508244","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3146610?t=1757508244","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/edf3d23f76a42bdadf62006097f9de51555f5955/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757508244","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/edf3d23f76a42bdadf62006097f9de51555f5955/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757508244","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains violent and explicit scenes involving antagonists, as well as bold costumes and fantasy elements presented from a male-gaze perspective, which may be uncomfortable for some players."},"demos":[{"appid":3304480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/fd49424f40a3ed0b391aada18cf5f953.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/fd49424f40a3ed0b391aada18cf5f953.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/fd4942