" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/5a38bebf67d8b781e6ec464afd7de301.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/5a38bebf67d8b781e6ec464afd7de301.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/5a38bebf67d8b781e6ec464afd7de301.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Diverse Cast, Intertwined Fates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A clumsy but caring older sister, a timid yet brave girl, a bratty little girl who calls herself a god, and a graceful, devoted young wife\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will meet them, accompany them, and make choices that shape their destinies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/b1ab9273cc1c8518642eb1cb9759f29d.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/b1ab9273cc1c8518642eb1cb9759f29d.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/b1ab9273cc1c8518642eb1cb9759f29d.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Atmospheric Japanese Horror Vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into a world of mysterious shrines and shrine maidens. Experience ancient rituals, eerie festivals, and hidden curses as you slowly unravel the buried truth...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f5926ed1670bb627b1ec46c2cb3be99d.poster.avif?t=1757508244\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f5926ed1670bb627b1ec46c2cb3be99d.webm?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f5926ed1670bb627b1ec46c2cb3be99d.mp4?t=1757508244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/6744800fc0142b77a54fbf45a8f0c6a4.avif?t=1757508244\" width=700 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is best suited for players who enjoy <strong>reading text</strong> to experience the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving puzzles requires reasoning and observation based on the text. Use your <strong>imagination</strong> to find the breakthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter difficulties, use the \u201cHint System\u201d to get crucial clues for a smoother experience.</p></li></ul>","developers":["MONRA"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/c51257161c1b087e14f645a9806985f5e189558c/header.jpg?t=1757508244","